# ---------- guidance & tutorial ----------
(r"Every empire needs brave soldiers! Tap Army.","Every empire needs brave soldiers. Tap Army."),
(r"Knowledge is power, chief! Tap Research.","Knowledge is power, chief. Tap Research. It's my favourite place."),
(r"Tap Missions. This is where the treasure is!","Tap Missions. This is where the treasure is."),
(r"Nobody wins alone! Tap Alliance.","Nobody wins alone, chief. Tap Alliance."),
(r"Now let's see the big world outside our walls! Tap World.","Now let's see the great world beyond our walls. Tap World."),
(r"Everything is just one tap away. Open the Menu!","Everything is one tap away. Open the Menu."),
(r"Train soldiers here! Each kind beats some enemies and loses to others. Tap any troop and I'll tell you its strengths.","Train soldiers here. Each kind beats some enemies and loses to others. Tap any troop, and I'll tell you its strengths."),
(r"What we learn here lasts forever, and it opens new troops and new ages! Tap any study and I'll explain it.","What we learn here lasts forever, and it opens new troops and new ages. Tap any study, and I'll explain it."),
(r"Quests, daily goals and trophies! Anything with a red badge is a reward. Collect them all!","Quests, daily goals and trophies. Anything with a red badge is a reward. Collect them all."),
(r"Heroes grow too! Every battle they lead makes them stronger. Tomes of Tactics give a quick boost.","Heroes grow too. Every battle we lead makes us stronger. Tomes of Tactics give a quick boost."),
(r"Quick buttons are on top, and every screen is below. Tap your ruler card to see your profile.","Quick buttons are on top, and every screen is below. Tap your ruler card to see your profile."),
(r"The radar shows us in gold, friends in green and rivals in red. Zoom with plus and minus, or tap the circle to fly home.","The radar shows us in gold, friends in green, rivals in red. Zoom with plus and minus, or tap the circle to fly home."),
(r"Drag with one finger to explore, and pinch to zoom. Tap anything on the map and I'll tell you what it is!","Drag with one finger to explore, and pinch to zoom. Tap anything on the map, and I'll tell you what it is."),
(r"Lost\? No worries, tap here to fly home.","Lost? Don't worry. Tap here to fly home."),
(r"Treasure! Glowing supply boxes appear near our land. Tap one to grab it!","Treasure. Glowing supply boxes appear near our land. Tap one to claim it."),
(r"This is the Finder! It finds food, wood, monsters, tribes and treasure, closest first.","This is the Finder. It finds food, wood, monsters, tribes and treasure, closest first."),
(r"Giant monsters and big events are listed here. Check it before you march!","Giant monsters and great events are listed here. Check before you march."),
(r"Friends speed up your timers, send gifts and fight giant monsters with you!","Friends speed up your timers, send gifts, and fight giant monsters beside you."),
(r"Friends make us strong! Help each other build faster, and team up against giant monsters.","Friends make us strong. Help each other build faster, and stand together against the giants."),
(r"Upgrading makes a building stronger and unlocks new ones. Tap Upgrade!","Upgrading makes a building stronger, and unlocks new ones. Tap Upgrade."),
(r"See the green arrow\? That building is ready to grow. Tap it!","See the green arrow? That building is ready to grow. Tap it."),
(r"Builders at work! Watch the timer count down. Short jobs can finish for free, and friends can help too.","The builders are at work. Watch the timer. Short jobs can finish for free, and friends can help."),
(r"Everything in our empire can grow! The Chieftain Hall is the tallest, and others can't pass it. Tap any building and I'll tell you its secret.","Everything in our empire can grow. The Chieftain Hall is the tallest, and nothing may pass it. Tap any building, and I'll tell you its secret."),
(r"Everything we learn here stays forever! Finish an age's big discovery to move to the next age.","Everything we learn here stays with us forever. Finish an age's great discovery to move to the next one."),
(r"Every troop beats some enemies and loses to others, like rock, paper, scissors! Train a mix, and you'll win more.","Every troop beats some enemies and loses to others, like rock, paper, scissors. Train a mix, and you'll win more."),
(r"Food, wood and stone! Our buildings make them every hour, and new treasures appear in later ages.","Food, wood and stone. Our buildings make them every hour, and new treasures appear in later ages."),
(r"Ten ages, from stone tools to starships! Every age brings new buildings and troops.","Ten ages, from stone tools to starships. Every age brings new buildings and new troops."),
(r"We will rise through ten ages, from stone to the stars. To advance, finish the age's key research, dig fragments at the Dig Site, and raise the Chieftain Hall. Every new age brings new buildings, troops and wonders.","We will rise through ten ages, from stone to the stars. To advance, finish the age's key research, dig fragments at the Dig Site, and raise the Chieftain Hall."),
(r"This strip shows what everyone is doing: builders, scholars and armies. Tap any of them to jump right there!","This strip shows what everyone is doing: builders, scholars and armies. Tap any of them to go straight there."),
(r"Speed-ups are best when every builder and scholar is busy. Spend smart, chief!","Speed-ups are best when every builder and scholar is busy. Spend them wisely, chief."),
(r"Only your leading hero's powers count in battle. Pick the right hero for each fight!","Only the leading hero's powers count in battle. Choose the right hero for each fight."),
(r"Plan big battles here. Always scout first, then strike where they're weakest.","Plan great battles here. Always scout first, then strike where they're weakest."),
(r"Monsters drop special materials. Bring them here and we'll forge gear for your hero!","Monsters drop special materials. Bring them here, and we'll forge gear for your hero."),
(r"Monsters drop forge materials and give your hero experience. If your army is small, pick one marked Easy.","Monsters drop forge materials and teach your hero. If our army is small, pick one marked Easy."),
(r"Rewards are waiting! Anything with a red badge is ready, so tap and collect.","Rewards are waiting. Anything with a red badge is ready, so tap and collect."),
(r"Come back every day for a gift! Events here give the best hero shards.","Come back every day for a gift. Events here give the best hero shards."),
(r"Come back tomorrow for three new ones.","Come back tomorrow for three new ones."),
(r"You already opened today's chest. Come back tomorrow!","You already opened today's chest. Come back tomorrow."),
(r"Your empire grows stronger. Rewards were added to your city.","Your empire grows stronger. The rewards are already in the city."),
(r"Know your enemy, chief! Here's every giant monster, where it lives and when it attacks.","Know your enemy, chief. Here is every giant, where it lives, and when it strikes."),
(r"Whoa, a monster! Check its level first. Bring a big army, or team up with friends.","A monster. Check its level first, chief. Bring a big army, or team up with friends."),
(r"Careful, chief. Enemy scouts are watching us. Someone may attack soon!","Careful, chief. Enemy scouts are watching us. Someone may attack soon."),
(r"An enemy army is coming! Bring our troops home, raise a shield, or call our friends for help!","An enemy army is coming. Bring our troops home, raise a shield, or call our friends for help."),
(r"Can't hear your hero\? Open the menu and tap Voice check.","Can't hear me? Open the menu and tap Voice check."),
(r"Tap anywhere to hear your hero.","Tap anywhere to hear me."),
(r"Hello chief. Can you hear me\?","Hello, chief. Can you hear me?"),
(r"Voices on, chief.","There you are. I can speak again, chief."),
(r"Welcome, chief! I'm Hypatia. These ruins hold a power older than any empire. Together we'll take our people from the Stone Age to the stars.","Hello, chief. I'm Hypatia. These ruins hold a power older than any empire. Together, we'll take our people from the Stone Age to the stars."),
(r"You're ready, chief! Follow the quests and I'll be right beside you. Here's a war chest to begin our legend!","You're ready, chief. Follow the quests, and I'll be right beside you. Here's a war chest to begin our story."),
(r"That's you! Pick an avatar from your heroes, write a bio, and see how you rank. Other rulers see this card when they tap your banner.","That's you. Pick an avatar, write a few words about yourself, and see how you rank. Other rulers see this card when they tap your banner."),
(r"Do this first!","Do this first."),
(r"All goals done!","All goals done."),
(r"Raid the Rival Tribe for loot!","Raid the Rival Tribe for loot."),
(r"New VIP level!","A new VIP level."),
(r"More bonuses unlocked for your empire.","More bonuses unlocked for your empire."),
(r"Supply caches! Fly to one and tap it to claim free resources.","Supply caches. Fly to one and tap it to claim free resources."),
(r"Tap a picture to see the nearest ones, then press Go and I'll take you there. Wagons gather the fields; your army hunts monsters and raids tribes. Easy, Fair and Hard tell you how tough a target is.","Tap a picture to see the nearest ones, then press Go, and I'll take you there. Easy, Fair and Hard tell you how tough a target is."),
(r"This is the Finder. Tap a picture to find the closest ones, then press Go and I'll take you there.","This is the Finder. Tap a picture to find the closest ones, then press Go, and I'll take you there."),
(r"Adviser voices aren't available in this browser view. Subtitles will show instead. Open the game in Chrome or Safari to hear them.","My voice can't reach you in this browser view, so you'll see my words instead. Open the game in Chrome or Safari to hear me."),
# ---------- the map ----------
(r"A resource field! Send wagons here. The richer the field, the more each wagon brings home.","A resource field. Send wagons here. The richer the field, the more each wagon brings home."),
(r"A rival tribe! Beat their camp for loot and hero experience, but check their strength first.","A rival tribe. Beat their camp for loot and experience, but check their strength first."),
(r"Another empire! Scout before you strike, because they can strike back.","Another empire. Scout before you strike, because they can strike back."),
(r"Other empires. Scout them before you attack, and remember they can strike back.","Other empires. Scout them before you attack, and remember, they can strike back."),
(r"Food fields. Send your gatherers to the closest one, and they'll carry the harvest home.","Food fields. Send gatherers to the closest one, and they'll carry the harvest home."),
(r"Forests for timber. We always need more wood, so keep a wagon on one of these.","Forests for timber. We always need more wood, so keep a wagon on one of these."),
(r"Rock fields give stone for walls and upgrades. Pick the nearest and tap Go.","Rock fields give stone for walls and upgrades. Pick the nearest and tap Go."),
(r"Ore for metal. Stronger troops and gear need it, so gather it whenever you can.","Ore for metal. Stronger troops and gear need it, so gather it whenever you can."),
(r"Oil fields fuel our tanks and aircraft. Claim them before our rivals do.","Oil fields fuel our tanks and aircraft. Claim them before our rivals do."),
(r"Rival tribes guard loot. Beat their camp to grow stronger, but check the badge first: Easy, Fair or Hard.","Rival tribes guard loot. Beat their camp to grow stronger, but check the badge first: Easy, Fair or Hard."),
(r"Ancient ruins! Explore one to dig up relics, rare materials and old secrets. The closest ones are at the top.","Ancient ruins. Explore one to dig up relics, rare materials and old secrets. Oh, I love ruins. The closest ones are at the top."),
(r"A wonder! The alliance that holds it gets a special blessing. Let's take it in the conquest phase!","A wonder. The alliance that holds it gets a special blessing. Let's take it in the conquest phase."),
(r"The wonders of the world. Alliances fight to hold them for their blessings.","The wonders of the world. Alliances fight to hold them for their blessings."),
(r"Wonders bless the alliance that holds them. Here's where they are and who has them.","Wonders bless the alliance that holds them. Here's where they are, and who holds them."),
(r"The Royal Capital! Hold it and your alliance leader becomes Sovereign. It opens in the conquest phase.","The Royal Capital. Hold it, and your alliance leader becomes Sovereign. It opens in the conquest phase."),
(r"\+5% attack and defence for the holding alliance, and its leader is crowned Sovereign.","Five percent more attack and defence for the alliance that holds it, and its leader is crowned Sovereign."),
# ---------- giants, the pyramid, the gods ----------
(r"Look out, the Orbital Devourer has landed! It won't stay long, so call your friends and attack fast.","Look out. The Orbital Devourer has landed. It won't stay long, so call your friends and strike fast."),
(r"Descends from orbit onto plains, desert or forest roughly once every four hours and stays about three. Every empire nearby is threatened, so rally your alliance.","It falls from orbit onto plains, desert or forest about every four hours, and stays about three. Every empire nearby is in danger, so rally your alliance."),
(r"Four conduits rise around the Ancient Pyramid when it awakens. Destroy all four to break its shield.","Four conduits rise around the Ancient Pyramid when it wakes. Destroy all four to break its shield."),
(r"The pyramid is waking up! Four glowing towers rise around it. Break all four and its shield falls.","The pyramid is waking up, chief. Four glowing towers rise around it. Break all four, and its shield falls."),
(r"Yes! The pyramid's shield is down. Attack now, chief!","Its shield is down. Now, chief. Attack now."),
(r"The Pyramid Overlord has risen, its last guardian! We'll need every army we have.","The Pyramid Overlord has risen, its last guardian. We'll need every army we have."),
(r"The pyramid is open! The first alliance to hold it gets its power. Hurry!","The pyramid is open. The first alliance to hold it gets its power. Hurry, chief."),
(r"An alliance has taken the pyramid! If they hold it long enough, it's theirs for good.","An alliance has taken the pyramid. If they hold it long enough, it's theirs."),
(r"The pyramid has been conquered. Its power belongs to the winners, for now.","The pyramid has been conquered. Its power belongs to the winners, for now."),
(r"The Ancient Pyramid, the heart of everything! When it wakes up, it will need every army we have.","The Ancient Pyramid. The heart of everything. When it wakes, it will take every army we have."),
(r"The Ancient Pyramid is waking up! It was never a tomb. It is a machine, and it is standing up. Defeat it to open the doors.","The Ancient Pyramid is waking. It was never a tomb, chief. It's a machine, and it's standing up. Defeat it to open the doors."),
(r"The Ancient Pyramid's last defender. It rises during the pyramid siege, after the four Energy Conduits fall.","The Ancient Pyramid's last defender. It rises during the siege, after the four Energy Conduits fall."),
(r"The alien megastructure at the heart of the world. It wakes in stages: conduits rise, its shield falls, the Overlord fights, and the alliance that holds it last claims its power.","The machine at the heart of the world. It wakes in stages: conduits rise, its shield falls, the Overlord fights, and the alliance that holds it last claims its power."),
(r"The Awakened Pyramid has fallen.","The Awakened Pyramid has fallen."),
(r"The Awakened Pyramid has raised its glyph pylons again.","The Awakened Pyramid has raised its glyph pylons again."),
(r"Not active. They appear as the pyramid awakens.","Not active. They appear when the pyramid wakes."),
(r"None alive right now: it will return.","None alive right now. It will return."),
(r"Not in our skies. You'll be warned the moment it descends.","Not in our skies. I'll warn you the moment it comes down."),
(r"From the Renaissance Age on, five Ancient Elementals tear through the celestial rifts. Defeat all five within two days and The Convergence forms.","From the Renaissance Age on, five Ancient Elementals tear through the rifts in the sky. Defeat all five within two days, and the Convergence forms."),
(r"One of the five seals of the Celestial Convergence\. (?P<n>.+)","One of the five seals of the Convergence. {n}"),
(r"Hundreds of cubes are converging!","Hundreds of cubes are coming together."),
(r"OMEGA-0, the First Cube, has assembled.","OMEGA-0, the First Cube, has assembled."),
(r"OMEGA-0 has rebuilt its defence drones.","OMEGA-0 has rebuilt its defence drones."),
(r"Its final transmission is gone into the dark, and the great doors stand open.","Its last message is gone into the dark, and the great doors stand open."),
(r"Eryndor, the Gate Sovereign, has stepped through.","Eryndor, the Gate Sovereign, has stepped through."),
(r"Morvath, the Hollow King, has risen.","Morvath, the Hollow King, has risen."),
(r"The fallen rise again around Morvath, the Hollow King. His spectral guard has returned.","The fallen rise again around Morvath, the Hollow King. His ghostly guard has returned."),
(r"Solkaris, the Sun Devourer, has descended.","Solkaris, the Sun Devourer, has come down."),
(r"Solkaris's solar wheel is fully charged! Its beam burns twice as hard and its light shields it. Keep striking to break the charge.","Solkaris's wheel is fully charged. Its beam burns twice as hard, and its light shields it. Keep striking to break the charge."),
(r"Tharok, the Worldbreaker, has torn itself out of the mountains.","Tharok, the Worldbreaker, has torn itself out of the mountains."),
(r"Tharok's stone armour cracks open! Its burning core is exposed. Strike now, before the stone closes again.","Tharok's armour is cracking open. Its burning core is showing. Strike now, before the stone closes."),
(r"Tharok's stone armour has closed over its core again.","Tharok's stone armour has closed over its core again."),
(r"Varkhoss, the Iron Cataclysm, has unfolded.","Varkhoss, the Iron Cataclysm, has unfolded."),
(r"Varkhoss deploys its gun turrets! Destroy them to strip its defences.","Varkhoss is putting out gun turrets. Destroy them to strip its defences."),
(r"An abandoned fortress is moving!","An abandoned fortress is moving."),
(r"The battlefield falls silent.","The battlefield falls silent."),
(r"The ground splits!","The ground is splitting."),
(r"The sky cracks open!","The sky is cracking open."),
