# ---------- the Echo Stones and the Eclipse ----------
(r"A voice in the stone, chief. And she knew we would come.","A voice in the stone, chief. And she knew we would come. How long has she been waiting?"),
(r"Architects. I wonder what they were like.","The Architects. I wonder what they were like. I wonder if they looked at the same stars."),
(r"A lock in the sky. Let's keep it shut, chief.","A lock in the sky. Let's keep it shut, chief."),
(r"So that's why the wonders feel special. Let's guard them.","So that's why the wonders feel special. We'll guard them."),
(r"Guards, not monsters. I'll remember that when we fight them.","Guards, not monsters. I'll remember that when we fight them."),
(r"I can hear it too now. One, and one, and one.","I can hear it too now. One, and one, and one. Like counting."),
(r"We won't go out, chief. Not this time.","We won't go out, chief. Not this time."),
(r"A hive that wants the door open\? Not while I'm here.","A hive that wants the door open? Not while I'm here."),
(r"Warden Hearts. Strong stuff. Let's use them well.","Warden Hearts. They were holding back the end. Let's use them well."),
(r"To the stars, then. And we'll take her with us.","To the stars, then. And we'll take her with us."),
(r"Chief, the old obelisks on the map hum at night. Tap one and listen.","Chief, the old obelisks on the map hum at night. Tap one, and listen."),
(r"A new chapter of the Chronicle begins! This week's giant guards a seal. Bring it down together.","A new chapter of the Chronicle begins. This week's giant guards a seal. Bring it down together."),
(r"The seal held, chief! The Chronicle will remember this.","The seal held, chief. The Chronicle will remember this."),
(r"The seal cracked. We'll be stronger next time, chief.","The seal cracked. We'll be stronger next time, chief."),
(r"A Warden Heart! Take it to the Forge, chief.","A Warden Heart. Take it to the Forge, chief."),
(r"One of the seals is getting weak, chief. Beat the Hive near the wonders to make it strong again.","One of the seals is getting weak, chief. Beat the Hive near the wonders to make it strong again."),
(r"You found every echo, chief! You're the Keeper of the Echo now.","You found every echo, chief. You're the Keeper of the Echo now."),
(r"The sun is going dark, chief! Hold the seals!","The sun is going dark, chief. Hold the seals."),
(r"We made it to the stars, chief! Open the Chronicle. Our story goes on.","We made it to the stars, chief. Open the Chronicle. Our story goes on."),
(r"The Eclipse is here, chief! Every seal counts now!","The Eclipse is here, chief. Every seal counts now."),
(r"We survived the Eclipse, chief! The door held!","We survived the Eclipse, chief. The door held."),
(r"The Eclipse hurt us, chief. But we're still standing.","The Eclipse hurt us, chief. But we're still standing."),
(r"A scar on the seal, chief. It will take a long time to heal.","A scar on the seal, chief. It will take a long time to heal."),
